WEBVTT

00:00:05.698 --> 00:00:11.495
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:16.341
Click Edit Staying Safe Online.

00:00:16.591 --> 00:00:22.591
Check that Before you publish
shows every step done.

00:00:24.443 --> 00:00:28.295
Click Publish.

00:00:28.545 --> 00:00:32.397
Click Publish now.

00:00:32.647 --> 00:00:38.309
Wait until you see Unpublish.

00:00:38.559 --> 00:00:43.758
Click Unpublish to hide the video again.

00:00:44.008 --> 00:00:48.339
Click Unpublish to confirm.

00:00:48.589 --> 00:00:54.116
Wait until you see Publish.
